        "@value": "GENERAL Uniform and equipment"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "VII",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_29",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_30"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SAVING AND TRANSITIONAL Existing committees"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All committees established under the Directive No. 15 of the National Security Council and in force immediately before the commencement of this Act shall, upon the commencement of this Act, continue to remain in force until dissolved pursuant to section 44 of the National Security Council Act 2016 [Act 776]. Existing Anti-Smuggling Unit"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_30__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_30__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_30__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any act done or action taken prior to the commencement of this Act by the existing Anti-Smuggling Unit established by the Federal Government shall be deemed to have been done or taken by the Agency under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_30__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VII__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any directive, order or decision made by the existing Anti-Smuggling Unit and in force immediately before the commencement of this Act shall, upon the commencement of this Act, so far as it is consistent with this Act, continue to remain in force until it is revoked by the Agency."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An officer of the Agency shall be supplied with such uniform and equipment and wear such badges of rank as the Minister may determine. Uniform and equipment to be delivered up on ceasing to be officer of Agency"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_17__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_17__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_17__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "When an officer of the Agency ceases to be the officer of the Agency he shall, within fourteen days, deliver to the person appointed by the Commissioner General for that purpose his uniform and equipment which have been supplied to him."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_17__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An officer of the Agency who, having ceased to be an officer of the Agency, without good cause fails to comply with subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three months or to both, and, in addition, shall be liable to pay the value of the property not delivered up, and such value may be ascertained by the court in a summary manner and shall be recoverable as a fine. Personation"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person not being an officer of the Agency who—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "pretends to be an officer of the Agency knowing that he is not;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "falsely personates an officer of the Agency; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in such assumed character does or attempts to do any act under colour of being an officer of the Agency, commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be punished with imprisonment for a term not exceeding seven years or be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to both. Rank of officer of Agency"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The ranks of the officers of the Agency are as set out in the Schedule."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, amend the Schedule. Prosecution"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No prosecution for an offence under this Act shall be instituted except by, or with the written consent of, the Public Prosecutor. Obligations of secrecy"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except for any of the purposes of this Act or for the purposes of any civil or criminal proceedings under any written law or where otherwise authorized by the Agency—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "no officer of the Agency or committee or any person attending any meeting of the Agency, High Level Committee or Coordinating Committee, whether during or after his tenure of office or employment, shall disclose any information obtained by him in the course of his duties; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "no other person who has by any means access to any information or document relating to the affairs of the Agency shall disclose such information or document."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to both. Protection against suits and legal proceedings"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No action, suit, prosecution or any other proceedings shall lie or be brought, instituted or maintained in any court against the Agency, any committee, any officer of the Agency or member of committee, or personnel of other Government Entities in respect of any act, neglect or default done or omitted by it or him in good faith, in such capacity. Public servant"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every officer of the Agency or member of committee or personnel of other Government Entities while discharging his duty or performing his functions under this Act in such capacity shall be deemed to be a public servant within the meaning of the Penal Code [Act 574]. Public Authorities Protection Act 1948"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against the Agency, any committee, any officer of the Agency or member of committee, or personnel of other Government Entities in respect of any act, neglect or default done or committed by it or him in good faith or any omission by it or him in good faith, in such capacity. Standing Orders"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Commissioner General may issue administrative orders to be called “Standing Orders”, consistent with the provisions of this Act, on the general control, training, duties and responsibilities of officers of the Agency, and for such other matters as may be necessary or expedient for the good administration of the Agency or for the prevention of the abuse of power or neglect of duty, and generally for ensuring the efficient and effective functioning of the Agency. Protection of informers from discovery"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except as provided in this section, no witness in any civil or criminal proceedings shall be obliged or permitted to disclose the name or address of any informer or to state any matter which might lead to his discovery."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If any book, document or paper which are in evidence or liable to inspection in any civil or criminal proceedings contain any entry in which any informer is named or described or which might lead to the discovery of the informer, the court shall cause all such passages to be concealed from view or to be obliterated so far only as may be necessary to protect the informer from discovery."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If in the trial for any offence under this Act or any regulations made under the Act, the court, after full enquiry into the case, is of the opinion that the informer wilfully made in his complaint a material statement which he knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true, or if in any other proceedings the court is of opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties thereto without the discovery of the informer, the court may require the production of the original complaint, if in writing, and permit enquiry and require full disclosure concerning the informer. Evidence of agent provocateur admissible"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_27__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_27__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_27__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding any law or rule of law to the contrary, in any proceedings against any person for an offence under this Act, no agent provocateur shall be presumed to be unworthy of credit by reason only of his having attempted to commit or to abet, or having abetted or having been engaged in a criminal conspiracy to commit such offence if the main purpose of such attempt, abetment or engagement was to secure evidence against such person."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_27__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding any law or rule of law to the contrary, a conviction for any offence under this Act solely on the uncorroborated evidence of any agent provocateur shall not be illegal and no such conviction shall be set aside merely because the court which tried the case has failed to refer in the grounds of its judgment to the need to warn itself against the danger of convicting on such evidence. Regulations"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may make such regulations as are necessary or expedient to give full effect to or for carrying out the provisions of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Yang di-Pertuan Agong shall appoint a person from amongst the public officers to be the Commissioner General of the Agency for a period not exceeding three years and the person is eligible for reappointment for any period as the Yang di-Pertuan Agong considers necessary."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister shall appoint Deputies Commissioner General of the Agency from amongst the public officers for a period as the Minister thinks necessary or expedient for the purposes of carrying out and giving effect to the provisions of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Commissioner General shall be responsible to the High Level Committee and the Coordinating Committee for direction, command, control and supervision of all matters relating to the Agency."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Commissioner General may, for giving full effect to any provision of this Act or for more convenient implementation of the provisions of this Act, issue any direction, order or decision as the Commissioner General thinks necessary or expedient. Revocation and resignation of Commissioner General"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_12__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_12__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_12__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may, at any time, revoke the appointment of the Commissioner General appointed under subsection 11(1)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_12__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Commissioner General may, at any time, resign his office by giving a written notice to the Yang di-Pertuan Agong. Appointment of other officers of Agency"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_f"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister shall appoint such number of officers of the Agency from amongst the public officers as may be necessary for the purpose of carrying into effect the provisions of this Act as follows:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "police officers as specified in the Police Act 1967 [Act 344];"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "officers of customs as specified in the Customs Act 1967 [Act 235];"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "officers of immigration as specified in the Immigration Act 1959/63 [Act 155];"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "officers of the National Anti-Drugs Agency as specified in the National Anti-Drugs Agency 2004 [Act 638];"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "officers of the National Kenaf and Tobacco Board as specified in the National Kenaf and Tobacco Board Act 2009 [Act 692]; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any other public officers as is considered necessary."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The appointment of other officers of the Agency under subsection (1) shall be for a period as the Minister thinks expedient."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An officer appointed under subsection (1) shall be subject to the direction, command, control and supervision of the Commissioner General or any other officer of the Agency superior to him in rank, and shall exercise his powers, perform his functions and discharge his duties in compliance with such direction, command or control as may be specified orally or in writing by the Commissioner General or any other officer of the Agency superior to him in rank. Powers of officers of Agency"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_14__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_14__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this Act—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_14__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "an officer of the Agency shall have all the powers of a police officer of whatever rank as provided for under the Criminal Procedure Code [Act 593], and such powers shall be in addition to the powers provided for under this Act; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_14__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "an officer of the Agency shall have all the powers conferred on an officer in charge of a police station under any other written law, and for such purpose the office of such officer shall be deemed to be a police station. Certificate of appointment"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A certificate of appointment in the form of an authority card shall be issued to each officer of the Agency appointed under this Act and the card shall be signed by the Commissioner General and shall be prima facie evidence of the appointment under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@/~sched_1",
      "@type": "akn:schedule",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/13/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "[Section 19] RANKS OF OFFICER OF THE AGENCY Commissioner General Deputy Commissioner General Commissioner Deputy Commissioner Superintendent Deputy Superintendent Assistant Superintendent Inspector Sub-Inspector Sergeant Major Sergeant Corporal Lance Corporal Constable"
      }
    }
  ]
}
